<title>USA: TENNIS-BAUSCH &amp; LOMB CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BAUSCH &amp; LOMB CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMELIA ISLAND, Florida 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bausch &amp; Lomb Championships women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 1-Jana Novotna (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 1-6 6-1</p>
<p>2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat 16-Ruxandra Dragomir</p>
<p>(Romania) 6-3 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>4-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 13-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>8-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Alexandra Fusai (France) 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>9-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Marlene Weingartner</p>
<p>(Germany) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>11-Mary Pierce (France) beat 5-Anke Huber (Germany) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Jana Kandarr (Germany) beat Mariana Diaz Oliva (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
</text>
